cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, its prompts or its paper, please cite it as below."
title: "Reversible Faces Benchmark"
type: dataset
version: "2.0"  # version of the repository and the paper
date-released: "2026-10-29"
abstract: >-
  A one-shot benchmark in which a language model writes a single SVG that shows
  one face upright and a different face rotated by 180 degrees, carrying a joke
  about a recent technology or AI event. Includes the prompts, scripts, model
  outputs, human evaluations from three pilot rounds, and an accompanying paper.
authors:
